(The applicant, being the Superintendent of the jail named in the heading of) Tj T*
(this application, where the person named in that heading is detained, submits) Tj T*
(this application under sub-section \(3\) of Section 479 of the Bharatiya Nagarik) Tj T*
(Suraksha Sanhita, 2023, and states as follows:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. The person named in the heading of this application has been in custody in) Tj T*
(   connection with the case\(s\) listed in this application since 1 June 2022.) Tj T*
(   As computed on 1 August 2026, the custody undergone is 1523 days, of which) Tj T*
(   1523 days count toward the period specified in sub-section \(1\) of Section) Tj T*
(   479.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. No offence charged in the case\(s\) listed in this application carries death) Tj T*
(   or imprisonment for life as one of the punishments specified for it, so the) Tj T*
(   exclusion in the parenthesis to sub-section \(1\) of Section 479 does not) Tj T*
(   apply.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. The applicable period is one-half of the maximum period of imprisonment) Tj T*
(   specified for the offence, on completion of which sub-section \(1\) provides) Tj T*
(   for release by the Court on bail.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. On 1 December 2025, the custody undergone completed one-half of the maximum) Tj T*
(   period of imprisonment specified for the offence charged, being the period) Tj T*
(   mentioned in sub-section \(1\) of Section 479 applicable to this person.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. The case\(s\) to which this application relates, and the offence\(s\) charged) Tj T*
(   in them, are listed below with the maximum period of imprisonment specified) Tj T*
(   for each offence. This application has been prepared on the basis that the) Tj T*
(   list is complete and that no other case is pending against this person; the) Tj T*
(   applicant must confirm the list's completeness against court records before) Tj T*
(   filing.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
