(STATUTORY BASIS) Tj T*
(  s.479\(3\):) Tj T*
(    "The Superintendent of jail, where the accused person is detained, on) Tj T*
(    completion of one-half or one-third of the period mentioned in sub-section) Tj T*
(    \(1\), as the case may be, shall forthwith make an application in writing to) Tj T*
(    the Court to proceed under sub-section \(1\) for the release of such person) Tj T*
