(    on bail.") Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  s.479\(1\):) Tj T*
(    "\(1\) Where a person has, during the period of investigation, inquiry or) Tj T*
(    trial under this Sanhita of an offence under any law \(not being an offence) Tj T*
(    for which the punishment of death or life imprisonment has been specified) Tj T*
(    as one of the punishments under that law\) undergone detention for a period) Tj T*
(    extending up to one-half of the maximum period of imprisonment specified) Tj T*
(    for that offence under that law, he shall be released by the Court on) Tj T*
(    bail:) Tj T*
(    Provided that where such person is a first-time offender \(who has never) Tj T*
(    been convicted of any offence in the past\) he shall be released on bond by) Tj T*
(    the Court, if he has undergone detention for the period extending up to) Tj T*
(    one-third of the maximum period of imprisonment specified for such offence) Tj T*
(    under that law:) Tj T*
(    Provided further that the Court may, after hearing the Public Prosecutor) Tj T*
(    and for reasons to be recorded by it in writing, order the continued) Tj T*
(    detention of such person for a period longer than one-half of the said) Tj T*
(    period or release him on bail bond instead of his bond:) Tj T*
(    Provided also that no such person shall in any case be detained during the) Tj T*
(    period of investigation, inquiry or trial for more than the maximum period) Tj T*
(    of imprisonment provided for the said offence under that law.) Tj T*
(    Explanation.óIn computing the period of detention under this section for) Tj T*
(    granting bail, the period of detention passed due to delay in proceeding) Tj T*
(    caused by the accused shall be excluded.") Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  The maximum periods of imprisonment stated in this application are taken) Tj T*
(  from the central enactments as recorded. A State amendment not printed in) Tj T*
(  the stored consolidation cannot be detected by this system; the applicant) Tj T*
(  should confirm against any State amendment applicable in this jurisdiction) Tj T*
(  before filing.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  The special enactments checked for their own bail restrictions are those) Tj T*
(  recorded in the system that produced this application; the Supreme Court's) Tj T*
(  Category C list in Satender Kumar Antil is itself non-exhaustive. The) Tj T*
(  applicant should confirm before filing that no other special enactment with) Tj T*
(  its own bail restriction applies to the offence charged.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PRAYER) Tj T*
(  It is therefore prayed that this Court may proceed under sub-section \(1\) of) Tj T*
(  Section 479 of the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, 2023 for the release) Tj T*
(  of the person named in the heading of this application, as that sub-section) Tj T*
(  provides.) Tj T*
